[I] D-Bus service exposing IIO accelerometer/light/proximity sensors

[T] iio-sensor-proxy is a D-Bus proxy for Industrial I/O (IIO) sensors,
[T] exposing accelerometers, ambient light sensors, compasses and proximity
[T] sensors so desktop environments can react to orientation changes, adjust
[T] screen brightness, or feed compass data to apps.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/hadess/iio-sensor-proxy

[A] Bastien Nocera <hadess@hadess.net>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/system

[L] GPL3
[V] 3.9

